      "side": 1,
      "message": "`static_cast\u003cDWORD\u003e` could silently truncate if `s.size_bytes()` exceeds 4GB (i.e. larger than `MAXDWORD`). Consider using `pdfium::base::checked_cast\u003cDWORD\u003e` (from `core/fxcrt/numerics/safe_conversions.h`) to fail safely if such large buffers are ever passed. The same applies to `WriteFile` below.",
